Build buildroot image for rpi4b, rpi5, opi5, rockpi4b and rk3328:

sudo dnf install 'perl(Time::Piece)' 'perl(open)' 'perl(English)' 'perl(ExtUtils::MakeMaker)' 'perl(Thread::Queue)' 'perl(FindBin)' 'perl(IPC::Cmd)' 'perl(Math::BigInt)' 'perl(Math::BigRat)' patch

Input files: ../kernel/linux-rpi4b/arch/arm64/boot/Image
             ../kernel/linux-rpi4b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/broadcom/bcm2711-rpi-4-b.dtb
             ../kernel/linux-rpi4b/tmp/lib/modules/*
             ../kernel/linux-rpi5/arch/arm64/boot/Image
             ../kernel/linux-rpi5/arch/arm64/boot/dts/broadcom/bcm2712-rpi-5-b.dtb
             ../kernel/linux-rpi5/tmp/lib/modules/*

cd ~/build-5sbc/buildroot
wget https://buildroot.org/downloads/buildroot-2026.05.tar.xz
tar -xJf buildroot-2026.05.tar.xz
mv buildroot-2026.05 buildroot

For raspberrypi5:
vi ./buildroot/configs/raspberrypi5_defconfig ( delete KERNEL, RPI_FIRMWARE, TOOLCHAIN_EXTERNAL, BR2_DOWNLOAD_FORCE_CHECK_HASHES=y, BR2_GLOBAL_PATCH_DIR, add BR2_ROOTFS_POST_IMAGE_SCRIPT="support/scripts/genimage.sh", add BR2_ROOTFS_POST_SCRIPT_ARGS="-c board/raspberrypi5/genimage.cfg", append ./patches/rpi5_defconfig)
cp -r ./patches/raspberrypi5/* ./buildroot/board/raspberrypi5/

For raspberrypi4b:
vi ./buildroot/configs/raspberrypi4_64_defconfig ( delete KERNEL, RPI_FIRMWARE, BR2_DOWNLOAD_FORCE_CHECK_HASHES=y, BR2_GLOBAL_PATCH_DIR, add BR2_ROOTFS_POST_IMAGE_SCRIPT="support/scripts/genimage.sh", add BR2_ROOTFS_POST_SCRIPT_ARGS="-c board/raspberrypi4-64/genimage.cfg", append ./patches/rpi4b_defconfig )
cp -r ./patches/raspberrypi4/* ./buildroot/board/raspberrypi4-64/

For opi5+:
vi ./buildroot/configs/orangepi_5_plus_defconfig ( delete KERNEL, UBOOT, BR2_DOWNLOAD_FORCE_CHECK_HASHES=y, BR2_PACKAGE_HOST_LINUX_HEADERS_CUSTOM_6_12=y, BR2_ROOTFS_DEVICE_CREATION_DYNAMIC_MDEV=y, BR2_GLOBAL_PATCH_DIR, append ./patches/orangepi_5_defconfig)
cp -r ./patches/orangepi-5/* ./buildroot/board/orangepi/orangepi-5-plus/

For rockpi4b:
vi ./buildroot/configs/rock4se_defconfig ( delete UBOOT, KERNEL, BR2_DOWNLOAD_FORCE_CHECK_HASHES=y, BR2_GLOBAL_PATCH_DIR, append ./patches/rockpi4_defconfig)
cp -r ./patches/rockpi-4/* ./buildroot/board/radxa/rock4se/

For roc-rk3328-cc:
vi ./buildroot/configs/rock4se_defconfig ( change BR2_cortex_a72_a53=y to BR2_cortex_a53=y, delete UBOOT, KERNEL, BR2_DOWNLOAD_FORCE_CHECK_HASHES=y, BR2_GLOBAL_PATCH_DIR, append ./patches/rk3328_defconfig)
cp -r ./patches/roc-rk3328-cc/* ./buildroot/board/radxa/rock4se/

cd buildroot
\rm -rf .config output
make clean
(rpi4b)                   make raspberrypi4_64_defconfig 
(rpi5)                    make raspberrypi5_defconfig
(rockpi4b, roc-rk3328-cc) make rock4se_defconfig
(opi5+)                   make orangepi_5_plus_defconfig
make

The result is in ./output/images/sdcard.img

Plugin usb3 stick to PC.   ( rockpi4b use sdcard )
sudo umount /dev/sda*
sudo dd if=./output/images/sdcard.img of=/dev/sda bs=4096 conv=notrunc,fsync status=progress

sudo partprobe /dev/sda
(rpi4b, rpi5) sudo mount /dev/sda1 /mnt
(rpi4b) sudo 7z x ~/Downloads/RPi4_UEFI_Firmware.zip -o/mnt && sync && sudo umount /mnt
Note: Don't overwrite dtb.
(rpi5)  sudo 7z x ~/Downloads/RPi5_UEFI_Release.zip -o/mnt && sync && sudo umount /mnt
Note: Don't overwrite dtb.

sudo mount /dev/sda2 /mnt
sudo vi /mnt/etc/network/interfaces ( delete everything after iface lo inet loopback )
sudo vi /mnt/etc/vsftpd.conf ( anonymous_enable=NO, local_enable=YES, write_enable=YES )
sync; sudo umount /mnt;
Eject sdcard/usb3 stick from PC.

Plugin sdcard to rockpi4b.
Plugin usb3 stick to rpi4b/rpi5.
Plugin usb3 stick and ethernet cable to orangepi_5_plus/roc-rk3328-cc.
(rpi4b) Esc -> Device Manager -> Rpi -> Advanced -> 3GB ( disable ) -> System Table (Devicetree) -> F10 -> Boot Manager -> first UEFI or SDCARD.
(rpi5)  Esc -> Rpi -> ACPI/ Device Tree -> System Table (Devicetree) -> F10 -> Boot Manager -> first UEFI or SDCARD.

login:
username: root
password: linaro

(rockpi4b, rpi5, rpi4b) wpa_passphrase your_SSID your_passphrase > /etc/ssid.conf
(rockpi4b, rpi5, rpi4b) wpa_supplicant -B -i wlan0 -c /etc/ssid.conf
(rockpi4b, rpi5, rpi4b) dhcpcd wlan0

ifconfig
ssh-keygen -R 192.168.86.211
ssh root@192.168.86.211

uname -a
adduser linaro

df .
date
aplay -l

-----------------------------------------------------
For rpi4b, rpi5, rockpi4b, opi5:
vi /etc/asound.conf ( add
pcm.!default {
    type plug
    slave.pcm {
        type hw
        card "vc4hdmi0"
        device 0
    }
}

ctl.!default {
    type hw
    card "vc4hdmi0"
}
)

alsactl -F restore

Note: rpckpi4b card "hdmisound"
      opi5     card "hdmi0"

-----------------------------------------------------
For roc-rk3328-cc:
vi /etc/asound.conf ( add
pcm.!default {
    type pulse
}

ctl.!default {
    type pulse
}
)
mkdir -p /home/linaro/pulse-runtime
export PULSE_RUNTIME_PATH=/home/linaro/pulse-runtime
pulseaudio --start
pactl list short sinks
pactl set-sink-volume 0 25%

------------------------------------------------------

(roc-rk3328-cc) pulseaudio --start
(roc-rk3328-cc) pactl set-sink-volume 0 25%
aplay /home/linaro/yoursong.wav
mpv /home/linaro/yoursong.mp3
mpv --vo=drm /home/linaro/yourvideo.mp4
(roc-rk3328-cc) mpv --vo=drm --vf=scale=800:480 --video-unscaled=yes /home/linaro/yourvideo.mp4

For rockpi4b:
bluetoothctl list
hciconfig hci0
hciconfig -a
hcitool dev
